            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "On a large, visible patio, on irregular stone, or where joint colour is part of the design, yes — the haze resistance and colour retention justify it. On a small utility path where nobody is looking closely, a big-box bag applied carefully will do the job for considerably less.",
